MODULE: ReadyReaderTornCut
TARGET: SnapshotExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: The public current-state reader combines new and old keys from one closure
PERTURBS: Observe

--- FIND
    /\ snapshots' = [snapshots EXCEPT ![c] = value[c]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ snapshots' = [snapshots EXCEPT ![c] = [k \in Keys |-> IF k = 1 THEN value[c][k] ELSE 0]]
--- END
